    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>Once per battle, when an enemy targets you with a spell, you can roll a save (11+ :&nbsp; [[d20&gt;=11]]) to counter the spell as an interrupt action. Success means the spell has no effect on you.</p>\n<p>At the GM&rsquo;s discretion, this ability also protects against&nbsp;monster attacks that are similar to spells, such as the&nbsp;breath of a dragon.</p>"
    },
